// tests/rfc5545_examples_tests.nv — every worked example RFC 5545
// section 3.8.5.3 prints, with every occurrence it lists.
//
// Generated by tools/rfc_examples.py, which also checks each list
// against python-dateutil's `rrule`.  Do not edit the table: run the
// tool.  The RFC writes the examples in New York time with some `UNTIL`
// values in UTC.  Each `UNTIL` here is the New York wall time it names,
// because this package has no zones.  The one example whose `UNTIL`
// contradicts its own text is written as the text says; the tool's
// comment names it.

use std.test
use std.str
use std.list
use civil
use rruleerror
use rruleiter
use rruleparse
use rruleset

// Label, DTSTART, the rule, and every occurrence the example lists.
